{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"@interface"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PWRichMediaManager","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"text":"NSObject","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSObject"}],"platforms":["iOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Single delegate-gate invariant","level":2,"anchor":"Single-delegate-gate-invariant"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"presentRichMedia:"},{"type":"text","text":" is the only place where "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PWRichMediaPresentingDelegate.shouldPresentRichMedia:"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is checked. All upstream paths — push (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PWInAppMessagesManager.presentRichMediaFromPush:"},{"type":"text","text":"),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"postEvent ("},{"code":"PWInAppMessagesManager.postEvent:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), and the public manual APIs"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PWModalRichMedia.presentRichMedia:"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"PWLegacyRichMedia.presentRichMedia:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") — must","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"route through this method. Downstream classes ("},{"code":"PWModalWindow","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"PWMessageViewController","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PWModalWindowConfiguration"},{"text":") do NOT re-check the delegate; they assume the gate","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"already approved the presentation."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Exception: native in-app resources (","type":"text"},{"code":"native-config.json","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in the ZIP) are routed to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PushwooshInApp"},{"type":"text","text":" module at the top of "},{"code":"presentRichMedia:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", BEFORE the gate, and are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"intentionally NOT subject to "},{"code":"shouldPresentRichMedia:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — they carry their own lifecycle","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"callbacks (onShown\/onClicked\/onClosed). The gate governs HTML \/ modal rich media only."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwrichmediamanager"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PWRichMediaManager"},{"type":"text","text":" is the singleton entry point for all rich media presentation."}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWRichMediaManager","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore"]]},"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWRichMediaManager\/delegate","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWRichMediaManager\/richMediaStyle"],"title":"Instance Properties"},{"title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWRichMediaManager\/presentRichMedia:"]},{"title":"Type Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWRichMediaManager\/sharedManager"]}],"metadata":{"externalID":"c:objc(cs)PWRichMediaManager","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"title":"PWRichMediaManager","roleHeading":"Class","fragments":[{"text":"PWRichMediaManager","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"class","navigatorTitle":[{"tex